{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:767ea757309f73a1","name":"Slave I","source":{"id":"source:reference-767ea757309f73a1","title":"Slave I","revision":18798,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:45:07Z","sha256":"d713e87f3432fd11d7ffee49ac23755316ad64ee542f499140b06aae2ec2c2ac","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18798","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Slave%20I&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-767ea757309f73a1","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Slave I"]}," is the personnel transport of the bounty hunter ",{"tag":"a","children":["Boba Fett"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Boba_Fett","referenceId":"reference:8d500571566e79a7"},". The ship, once belonging to his father ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jango Fett"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jango_Fett","referenceId":"reference:bf47d6b339ff73dd"},", is a heavily modified ",{"tag":"a","children":["Firespray-31 Patrol Craft"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Firespray-31_Patrol_Craft","referenceId":"reference:4332ec6d77d7f80b"},". Armed with more weapons than many ",{"tag":"a","children":["Capital Ships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Capital_Ships","referenceId":"reference:a08d2e2cd508d403"}," carry, ",{"tag":"i","children":["Slave I"]}," represents an example of how a Firespray-31 can be customized to fit the needs of an individual owner.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Slave I"]}," is fast, agile, and includes the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Combat Thrusters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Combat_Thrusters","referenceId":"reference:67aecd921f38dbd3"}," modification, allowing it to act as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"}," in ",{"tag":"a","childre